# Release notes *2.8.1*
<Now/>

Rate your experience with the previous release. Your feedback is important for us

<style>
    .rating { 
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row-reverse;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .rating input {
      display: none;
    }
    .rating label {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: #ccc;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .rating input:checked ~ label,
    .rating label:hover,
    .rating label:hover ~ label {
      color: rgb(248 113 113);
    }
    .feedback {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 400px;
      margin: 1rem auto;
      padding: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
    .submit-btn {
      display: block;
      margin: 0.5rem auto;
      padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }  
</style>

<form onsubmit="return false" class="flex flex-col" id="rating-c">
    <fieldset>
      <div class="rating" id="rating-form">
        <input type="radio" id="star5" name="rating" value="5" />
        <label for="star5">★</label>
        <input type="radio" id="star4" name="rating" value="4" />
        <label for="star4">★</label>
        <input type="radio" id="star3" name="rating" value="3" />
        <label for="star3">★</label>
        <input type="radio" id="star2" name="rating" value="2" />
        <label for="star2">★</label>
        <input type="radio" id="star1" name="rating" value="1" />
        <label for="star1">★</label>
      </div>
    </fieldset>
    <input type="text" id="feedback-form" name="feedback" style="width:20rem" class="border-1 ml-auto mr-auto align-center rounded-lg text-sm text-gray-700 ring-0 text-sm py-1" placeholder="one-line feedback..." maxlength="100" />
</form>

Tell your thoughts, what you would like to see or anything else. The form will be sent automatically once you have finished.

