.md
## Automated export to interactive HTML
We got rid of a hassle, that you needed to do in order to export notebooks with interactive elements. At least for the build-in functions such as:

<br/>

- `Manipulate`
- `ManipulatePlot`
- `ManipulateParametericPlot`
- `Animate`

this is a single click - __Automatic__


![](/attachments/Screenshot%202025-08-07%20at%2013.43.37-9cb.png)

Here __Manual sampling__ is the same, as __Dynamic HTML__ option was before.

Try it out!

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
## Automated export to interactive HTML
We got rid of a hassle, that you needed to do in order to export notebooks with interactive elements. At least for the build-in functions such as:

<br />

- `Manipulate`
- `ManipulatePlot`
- `ManipulateParametericPlot`
- `Animate`

this is a single click - __Automatic__


![](/attachments/Screenshot%202025-08-07%20at%2013.43.37-9cb.png)

Here __Manual sampling__ is the same, as __Dynamic HTML__ option was before.

Try it out!

