.md
## Bonus: LLM Autocompletion
This is totally optional feature, which was hidden in our modules for a long time.


![](/attachments/Screenshot%202025-08-12%20at%2015.13.37-c27.png)

In general it works on all kind of languages, including English 🙂


![](/attachments/Screenshot%202025-08-12%20at%2015.14.59-230.png)

By the default it uses the same endpoint as assistant chat window, i.e. OpenAPI API. 

:::note
To enable LLM autocompletion find a checkbox in the __Settings__ menu under the "AI Assistant" section.

And do not forget to set API Key in the designated field to authenticate your requests.
:::

%-------------------------------------------------------------------------%
Display: markdown
Type: Output
